{"seq":1,"slug":"custom-render-objects","title":"自定义 RenderObject：布局与绘制的底层控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/advanced/custom-render-objects","wordCount":694,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义-renderobject-布局与绘制的底层控制\">自定义 RenderObject：布局与绘制的底层控制</h1><p>Flutter 的 Widget 系统极其灵活，但某些场景下需要绕过 Widget 层，直接控制布局和绘制逻辑。自定义 <code>RenderObject</code> 是 Flutter 渲染系统的「最底层 API」——用于实现复杂自定义布局（如瀑布流、环形布局）、高频动画优化，或特殊绘制效果。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>RenderObject</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 渲染树的基本单元，负责布局（layout）和绘制（paint）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>RenderBox</strong></td>\n<td>最常用的 RenderObject 子类，使用 2D 笛卡尔坐标系和 BoxConstraints</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>BoxConstraints</strong></td>\n<td>传递给子节点的约束：minWidth/maxWidth/minHeight/maxHeight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>performLayout()</strong></td>\n<td>布局阶段：接收父约束，确定自身尺寸，安排子节点位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>paint()</strong></td>\n<td>绘制阶段：将内容绘制到 Canvas（通过 PaintingContext）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>parentData</strong></td>\n<td>父节点在子节点上存储的额外布局信息（如 BoxParentData 中的 offset）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>RenderProxyBox</strong></td>\n<td>委托给单个子节点的 RenderBox，只需重写感兴趣的方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>MultiChildRenderObjectWidget</strong></td>\n<td>支持多个子节点的 RenderObjectWidget 基类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"renderobject-层次结构\">RenderObject 层次结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  RO[RenderObject\\n抽象基类] --&gt; RB[RenderBox\\n2D 盒子模型]&#10;  RO --&gt; RS[RenderSliver\\n滚动元素]&#10;  RB --&gt; RPB[RenderProxyBox\\n单子节点委托]&#10;  RB --&gt; RCB[RenderConstrainedBox\\nSizedBox 等]&#10;  RPB --&gt; RP[RenderPadding]&#10;  RPB --&gt; RO2[RenderOpacity]&#10;  RB --&gt; RMCB[RenderFlex\\nRow/Column 实现]&#10;  RB --&gt; Custom[自定义 RenderBox]\">graph TD\n  RO[RenderObject\\n抽象基类] --&gt; RB[RenderBox\\n2D 盒子模型]\n  RO --&gt; RS[RenderSliver\\n滚动元素]\n  RB --&gt; RPB[RenderProxyBox\\n单子节点委托]\n  RB --&gt; RCB[RenderConstrainedBox\\nSizedBox 等]\n  RPB --&gt; RP[RenderPadding]\n  RPB --&gt; RO2[RenderOpacity]\n  RB --&gt; RMCB[RenderFlex\\nRow/Column 实现]\n  RB --&gt; Custom[自定义 RenderBox]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战-自定义单节点-renderbox\">实战：自定义单节点 RenderBox</h2><p>以一个「气泡聊天框」为例，演示自定义 RenderBox 的完整实现。气泡框需要在标准矩形框外绘制一个三角形尾巴：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 步骤一：定义 Widget（创建和更新 RenderObject）&#10;class ChatBubble extends SingleChildRenderObjectWidget {&#10;  final Color color;&#10;  final bool isMe;  // 气泡方向（左/右）&#10;&#10;  const ChatBubble({&#10;    required this.color,&#10;    required this.isMe,&#10;    super.child,&#10;    super.key,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  RenderChatBubble createRenderObject(BuildContext context) {&#10;    return RenderChatBubble(color: color, isMe: isMe);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  void updateRenderObject(BuildContext context, RenderChatBubble renderObject) {&#10;    renderObject&#10;      ..color = color&#10;      ..isMe = isMe;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 步骤二：实现 RenderObject&#10;class RenderChatBubble extends RenderProxyBox {&#10;  static const _tailWidth = 10.0;&#10;  static const _tailHeight = 8.0;&#10;  static const _radius = Radius.circular(12.0);&#10;&#10;  Color _color;&#10;  bool _isMe;&#10;&#10;  RenderChatBubble({required Color color, required bool isMe})&#10;      : _color = color, _isMe = isMe;&#10;&#10;  set color(Color value) {&#10;    if (_color == value) return;&#10;    _color = value;&#10;    markNeedsPaint();  // 只重绘，不重布局&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  set isMe(bool value) {&#10;    if (_isMe == value) return;&#10;    _isMe = value;&#10;    markNeedsPaint();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  void performLayout() {&#10;    // 给子节点提供约束（留出尾巴的空间）&#10;    if (child != null) {&#10;      child!.layout(&#10;        constraints.copyWith(&#10;          maxWidth: constraints.maxWidth - _tailWidth,&#10;        ),&#10;        parentUsesSize: true,&#10;      );&#10;      size = Size(&#10;        child!.size.width + _tailWidth,&#10;        child!.size.height,&#10;      );&#10;    } else {&#10;      size = constraints.smallest;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  void paint(PaintingContext context, Offset offset) {&#10;    final canvas = context.canvas;&#10;    final paint = Paint()&#10;      ..color = _color&#10;      ..style = PaintingStyle.fill;&#10;&#10;    // 气泡主体（圆角矩形）&#10;    final bubbleRect = _isMe&#10;        ? Rect.fromLTWH(offset.dx, offset.dy, size.width - _tailWidth, size.height)&#10;        : Rect.fromLTWH(offset.dx + _tailWidth, offset.dy, size.width - _tailWidth, size.height);&#10;&#10;    final rrect = RRect.fromRectAndRadius(bubbleRect, _radius);&#10;    canvas.drawRRect(rrect, paint);&#10;&#10;    // 气泡尾巴（三角形）&#10;    final tailPath = Path();&#10;    if (_isMe) {&#10;      final tailX = offset.dx + size.width - _tailWidth;&#10;      final tailY = offset.dy + size.height - _tailHeight * 2;&#10;      tailPath&#10;        ..moveTo(tailX, tailY)&#10;        ..lineTo(tailX + _tailWidth, tailY + _tailHeight)&#10;        ..lineTo(tailX, tailY + _tailHeight * 2)&#10;        ..close();&#10;    } else {&#10;      final tailX = offset.dx + _tailWidth;&#10;      final tailY = offset.dy + size.height - _tailHeight * 2;&#10;      tailPath&#10;        ..moveTo(tailX, tailY)&#10;        ..lineTo(offset.dx, tailY + _tailHeight)&#10;        ..lineTo(tailX, tailY + _tailHeight * 2)&#10;        ..close();&#10;    }&#10;    canvas.drawPath(tailPath, paint);&#10;&#10;    // 绘制子节点&#10;    if (child != null) {&#10;      final childOffset = _isMe ? offset : offset + const Offset(_tailWidth, 0);&#10;      context.paintChild(child!, childOffset);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 步骤一：定义 Widget（创建和更新 RenderObject）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ChatBubble extends SingleChildRenderObjectWidget {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final Color color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final bool isMe;  // 气泡方向（左/右）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const ChatBubble({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required this.color,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required this.isMe,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    super.child,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    super.key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  RenderChatBubble createRenderObject(BuildContext context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return RenderChatBubble(color: color, isMe: isMe);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void updateRenderObject(BuildContext context, RenderChatBubble renderObject) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    renderObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ..color = color</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ..isMe = isMe;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 步骤二：实现 RenderObject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class RenderChatBubble extends RenderProxyBox {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static const _tailWidth = 10.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static const _tailHeight = 8.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static const _radius = Radius.circular(12.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Color _color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool _isMe;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  RenderChatBubble({required Color color, required bool isMe})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      : _color = color, _isMe = isMe;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  set color(Color value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (_color == value) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _color = value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    markNeedsPaint();  // 只重绘，不重布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  set isMe(bool value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (_isMe == value) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _isMe = value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    markNeedsPaint();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void performLayout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 给子节点提供约束（留出尾巴的空间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (child != null) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      child!.layout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        constraints.copyWith(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          maxWidth: constraints.maxWidth - _tailWidth,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        parentUsesSize: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      size = Size(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        child!.size.width + _tailWidth,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        child!.size.height,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      size = constraints.smallest;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void paint(PaintingContext context, Offset offset) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final canvas = context.canvas;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final paint = Paint()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ..color = _color</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ..style = PaintingStyle.fill;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 气泡主体（圆角矩形）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final bubbleRect = _isMe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ? Rect.fromLTWH(offset.dx, offset.dy, size.width - _tailWidth, size.height)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        : Rect.fromLTWH(offset.dx + _tailWidth, offset.dy, size.width - _tailWidth, size.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final rrect = RRect.fromRectAndRadius(bubbleRect, _radius);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    canvas.drawRRect(rrect, paint);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 气泡尾巴（三角形）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final tailPath = Path();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (_isMe) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final tailX = offset.dx + size.width - _tailWidth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final tailY = offset.dy + size.height - _tailHeight * 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      tailPath</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..moveTo(tailX, tailY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..lineTo(tailX + _tailWidth, tailY + _tailHeight)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..lineTo(tailX, tailY + _tailHeight * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final tailX = offset.dx + _tailWidth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final tailY = offset.dy + size.height - _tailHeight * 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      tailPath</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..moveTo(tailX, tailY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..lineTo(offset.dx, tailY + _tailHeight)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..lineTo(tailX, tailY + _tailHeight * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    canvas.drawPath(tailPath, paint);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 绘制子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (child != null) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final childOffset = _isMe ? offset : offset + const Offset(_tailWidth, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      context.paintChild(child!, childOffset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战-多子节点自定义布局\">实战：多子节点自定义布局</h2><p>以「圆形排列子节点」布局为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// ParentData：父节点附加在子节点上的布局信息&#10;class CircularParentData extends ContainerBoxParentData&lt;RenderBox&gt; {&#10;  double angle = 0.0;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class RenderCircularLayout extends RenderBox&#10;    with ContainerRenderObjectMixin&lt;RenderBox, CircularParentData&gt;,&#10;         RenderBoxContainerDefaultsMixin&lt;RenderBox, CircularParentData&gt; {&#10;&#10;  double _radius;&#10;  RenderCircularLayout({required double radius}) : _radius = radius;&#10;&#10;  set radius(double value) {&#10;    if (_radius == value) return;&#10;    _radius = value;&#10;    markNeedsLayout();&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  void setupParentData(RenderBox child) {&#10;    if (child.parentData is! CircularParentData) {&#10;      child.parentData = CircularParentData();&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  void performLayout() {&#10;    const childConstraints = BoxConstraints.tightFor(width: 40, height: 40);&#10;    final children = getChildrenAsList();&#10;    final count = children.length;&#10;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; count; i++) {&#10;      final child = children[i];&#10;      child.layout(childConstraints, parentUsesSize: true);&#10;&#10;      // 将子节点均匀分布在圆周上&#10;      final angle = (2 * 3.14159 / count) * i;&#10;      final parentData = child.parentData! as CircularParentData;&#10;      parentData.offset = Offset(&#10;        _radius + _radius * cos(angle) - child.size.width / 2,&#10;        _radius + _radius * sin(angle) - child.size.height / 2,&#10;      );&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    size = Size(_radius * 2, _radius * 2);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  void paint(PaintingContext context, Offset offset) {&#10;    defaultPaint(context, offset);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  bool hitTestChildren(BoxHitTestResult result, {required Offset position}) {&#10;    return defaultHitTestChildren(result, position: position);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ParentData：父节点附加在子节点上的布局信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CircularParentData extends ContainerBoxParentData&#x3C;RenderBox> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  double angle = 0.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class RenderCircularLayout extends RenderBox</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    with ContainerRenderObjectMixin&#x3C;RenderBox, CircularParentData>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         RenderBoxContainerDefaultsMixin&#x3C;RenderBox, CircularParentData> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  double _radius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  RenderCircularLayout({required double radius}) : _radius = radius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  set radius(double value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (_radius == value) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _radius = value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    markNeedsLayout();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void setupParentData(RenderBox child) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (child.parentData is! CircularParentData) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      child.parentData = CircularParentData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void performLayout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const childConstraints = BoxConstraints.tightFor(width: 40, height: 40);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final children = getChildrenAsList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final count = children.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; count; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final child = children[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      child.layout(childConstraints, parentUsesSize: true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 将子节点均匀分布在圆周上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final angle = (2 * 3.14159 / count) * i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final parentData = child.parentData! as CircularParentData;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      parentData.offset = Offset(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _radius + _radius * cos(angle) - child.size.width / 2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _radius + _radius * sin(angle) - child.size.height / 2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    size = Size(_radius * 2, _radius * 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void paint(PaintingContext context, Offset offset) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultPaint(context, offset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool hitTestChildren(BoxHitTestResult result, {required Offset position}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return defaultHitTestChildren(result, position: position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"performlayout-约束传播规则\">performLayout 约束传播规则</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tight</code></td>\n<td>minWidth == maxWidth，minHeight == maxHeight（强制尺寸）</td>\n<td><code>SizedBox</code>、<code>Expanded</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>loose</code></td>\n<td>min 为 0，max 有限制</td>\n<td><code>Center</code>、<code>Padding</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>unbounded</code></td>\n<td>max 为无穷大</td>\n<td><code>ListView</code>、<code>SingleChildScrollView</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>infinite</code></td>\n<td>min 和 max 都为无穷大（不可用于 RenderBox）</td>\n<td>理论上不存在</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>黄金规则</strong>：父向子传递约束（从上到下），子向父报告尺寸（从下到上），父决定子的位置（存入 <code>parentData.offset</code>）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义-painter-推荐先用-custompaint\">自定义 Painter（推荐先用 CustomPaint）</h2><p>大多数自定义绘制场景不需要自定义 RenderObject——<code>CustomPaint</code> + <code>CustomPainter</code> 是更轻量的替代：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class WaveformPainter extends CustomPainter {&#10;  final List&lt;double&gt; amplitudes;&#10;  final Color color;&#10;&#10;  WaveformPainter({required this.amplitudes, required this.color})&#10;      : super(repaint: null);&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  void paint(Canvas canvas, Size size) {&#10;    final paint = Paint()&#10;      ..color = color&#10;      ..strokeWidth = 2.0&#10;      ..style = PaintingStyle.stroke;&#10;&#10;    final path = Path();&#10;    final barWidth = size.width / amplitudes.length;&#10;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; amplitudes.length; i++) {&#10;      final x = i * barWidth;&#10;      final barHeight = amplitudes[i] * size.height;&#10;      final y = (size.height - barHeight) / 2;&#10;      path.moveTo(x + barWidth / 2, y);&#10;      path.lineTo(x + barWidth / 2, y + barHeight);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    canvas.drawPath(path, paint);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  bool shouldRepaint(WaveformPainter oldDelegate) {&#10;    return oldDelegate.amplitudes != amplitudes;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class WaveformPainter extends CustomPainter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final List&#x3C;double> amplitudes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final Color color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  WaveformPainter({required this.amplitudes, required this.color})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      : super(repaint: null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void paint(Canvas canvas, Size size) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final paint = Paint()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ..color = color</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ..strokeWidth = 2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ..style = PaintingStyle.stroke;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final path = Path();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final barWidth = size.width / amplitudes.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; amplitudes.length; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final x = i * barWidth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final barHeight = amplitudes[i] * size.height;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final y = (size.height - barHeight) / 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      path.moveTo(x + barWidth / 2, y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      path.lineTo(x + barWidth / 2, y + barHeight);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    canvas.drawPath(path, paint);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool shouldRepaint(WaveformPainter oldDelegate) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return oldDelegate.amplitudes != amplitudes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"何时选择自定义-renderobject-vs-custompaint\">何时选择自定义 RenderObject vs CustomPaint</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自定义绘制效果（图表、波形、进度条）</td>\n<td><code>CustomPaint</code> + <code>CustomPainter</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准组件布局无法实现的自定义位置关系</td>\n<td><code>CustomMultiChildLayout</code> + <code>MultiChildLayoutDelegate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极致性能优化（减少 Widget 树层级）</td>\n<td>自定义 <code>RenderBox</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现瀑布流、环形等非标准多子节点布局</td>\n<td>自定义 <code>RenderBox</code> + <code>ContainerRenderObjectMixin</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要自定义 hit testing 逻辑</td>\n<td>自定义 <code>RenderBox</code>（覆写 <code>hitTest</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自定义 RenderObject 是 Flutter 渲染系统的「逃生舱」——当 Widget 系统提供的抽象不足以满足需求时使用。实践路径是：先尝试 <code>CustomPaint</code>（绘制）和 <code>CustomMultiChildLayout</code>（多子节点布局），这两者覆盖大多数场景；只有在需要完全控制布局逻辑或极致性能优化时，才深入到 <code>RenderBox</code> 层。掌握 <code>performLayout</code> 的约束传播规则和 <code>paint</code> 的 Layer 系统，是使用这套 API 的核心。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/widget-rendering-pipeline\">Widget 树与渲染管线</a> — RenderObject 在三棵树中的角色</li>\n<li><a href=\"platform-views-embedding\">Platform Views 嵌入</a> — 另一种突破 Flutter Widget 限制的手段</li>\n<li><a href=\"../production/performance-profiling\">性能分析与优化</a> — 使用 DevTools 验证自定义 RenderObject 的性能</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自定义 RenderObject：布局与绘制的底层控制","id":"自定义-renderobject-布局与绘制的底层控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RenderObject 层次结构","id":"renderobject-层次结构"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：自定义单节点 RenderBox","id":"实战-自定义单节点-renderbox"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：多子节点自定义布局","id":"实战-多子节点自定义布局"},{"level":2,"text":"performLayout 约束传播规则","id":"performlayout-约束传播规则"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义 Painter（推荐先用 CustomPaint）","id":"自定义-painter-推荐先用-custompaint"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选择自定义 RenderObject vs CustomPaint","id":"何时选择自定义-renderobject-vs-custompaint"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"导航与路由 2.0：GoRouter、声明式路由与深度链接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/navigation-routing"},"next":{"title":"Platform Views 嵌入：在 Flutter 中集成原生视图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/advanced/platform-views-embedding"}}